From: pattex67 <33281022+pattex67@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 09:08:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Clean up: drop investigation diagnostics (hwacod raw words,
 CreateNativeImage preference words, composite pitch and device, draw target
 device and block height, EDEN_NX2_GPU_WRITTEN_LISTS), hwacod and hwopus 100
 no longer logged as stubs, shader cache retry checks in one place

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
